_🔒 Security & Privacy_ | _🔵 Trivial_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Dokument dashboardu wychodzi bez nagłówków antyramkowych.**

Middleware ustawia tylko `Cache-Control`. Dokument dashboardu nie dostaje `X-Frame-Options` ani `Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'`, a na `APP_ORIGIN` w `localStorage` leży sesja Supabase. Obca strona może osadzić dashboard w iframe (clickjacking). Dołóż nagłówki dla odpowiedzi HTML.




<details>
<summary>🔒️ Propozycja nagłówków dla dokumentu</summary>

```diff
   routes.use('*', async (context, next) => {
     await next();

     if (context.res.ok) {
-      context.res.headers.set(
-        'Cache-Control',
-        context.req.path.startsWith(ASSETS_PREFIX) ? IMMUTABLE_CACHE_CONTROL : NO_CACHE_CONTROL,
-      );
+      const isAsset = context.req.path.startsWith(ASSETS_PREFIX);
+
+      context.res.headers.set(
+        'Cache-Control',
+        isAsset ? IMMUTABLE_CACHE_CONTROL : NO_CACHE_CONTROL,
+      );
+
+      if (!isAsset) {
+        context.res.headers.set('X-Frame-Options', 'DENY');
+        context.res.headers.set('Content-Security-Policy', "frame-ancestors 'none'");
+        context.res.headers.set('X-Content-Type-Options', 'nosniff');
+      }
     }
   });
```
</details>

<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

```suggestion
  routes.use('*', async (context, next) => {
    await next();

    if (context.res.ok) {
      const isAsset = context.req.path.startsWith(ASSETS_PREFIX);

      context.res.headers.set(
        'Cache-Control',
        isAsset ? IMMUTABLE_CACHE_CONTROL : NO_CACHE_CONTROL,
      );

      if (!isAsset) {
        context.res.headers.set('X-Frame-Options', 'DENY');
        context.res.headers.set('Content-Security-Policy', "frame-ancestors 'none'");
        context.res.headers.set('X-Content-Type-Options', 'nosniff');
      }
    }
  });
```

</details>

<!-- suggestion_end -->

